<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>BBC Chinese</title><subtitle type="html">BBC Chinese - BBC News , 中文 - 主頁</subtitle><id>https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/zhongwen/trad/rss.xml</id><updated>2026-10-02T05:54:31Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss.xml" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/trad" /><link rel="via" href="https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/zhongwen/trad/rss.xml" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>西班牙與中國愈走愈近，歐盟多方為何不滿？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx9808vgjy09o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-10-02T05:54:26Z</updated><published>2026-10-02T05:09:30Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx9808vgjy09o/trad--3063e71a6b74.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx9808vgjy09o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">全球局勢動盪之際，西班牙與中國意外走近，但這並非唯一不尋常的夥伴關係。</summary></entry><entry><title>康乃爾大學輪姦案調查：我們目前知道多少？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck0j3j415x0go/trad#0</id><updated>2026-10-02T05:54:28Z</updated><published>2026-10-02T02:31:44Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck0j3j415x0go/trad--601659493061.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck0j3j415x0go/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">該女子指稱，兩年前她在該大學一處兄弟會宿舍遭人下藥並遭到性侵。</summary></entry><entry><title>香港國安處以「23條」拘捕網媒記者，與8.31事件相關</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6wyzy7ykn5go/trad#0</id><updated>2026-10-02T05:53:25Z</updated><published>2026-10-01T08:48:59Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6wyzy7ykn5go/trad--6ce65b396617.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6wyzy7ykn5go/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">香港記者協會關注事件，指鄧浩榮是首名在涉嫌違反《維護國家安全條例》（俗稱「23條」）生效後，於公眾領域中因該例煽動罪被捕的新聞工作者。</summary></entry><entry><title>中國開始打擊AI戀愛關係，是過度干預還是先見之明？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmz9z9e4247vo/trad#0</id><updated>2026-10-02T05:53:25Z</updated><published>2026-10-01T08:12:13Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmz9z9e4247vo/trad--ed512c4d390c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmz9z9e4247vo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">北京正在打擊那些能夠模擬人際關係的AI聊天機器人。專家質疑這是否是正確的做法。</summary></entry><entry><title>「我喜歡證明別人錯了」：這些女性拿起工具，自己做裝修和水喉工程</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq36lg32d362o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-10-02T05:54:31Z</updated><published>2026-10-02T01:42:08Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq36lg32d362o/trad--1053cbb88aa1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq36lg32d362o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">女性DIY專家和女性工匠談及她們如何改變傳統男性主導的領域。</summary></entry><entry><title>日本收緊外國人居留條件，申請費用上調二十倍</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cxyvzvqp0z01o/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-02T05:53:25Z</updated><published>2026-10-01T07:38:15Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cxyvzvqp0z01o/trad--64e8587976b0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cxyvzvqp0z01o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">這次加費是高市政府收緊移民政策的一環，目的是管理快速增長的外國人口。</summary></entry><entry><title>鈉離子電池：「美國製造」能超越中國嗎？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwx2ze4g2d2go/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-02T05:53:25Z</updated><published>2026-10-01T01:58:40Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwx2ze4g2d2go/trad--f3fa3346fc1f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwx2ze4g2d2go/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">基於鈉離子技術的電池可以在美國使用本地採購的材料生產。</summary></entry><entry><title>軍情五處警告：中國資助英國研究，成果交予北京間諜機關</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmwyz8y494xvo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-02T05:53:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-30T16:46:19Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmwyz8y494xvo/trad--3ce57e9fe961.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmwyz8y494xvo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">當局敦促英國各大學，停止與中國通用技術研究院往來，該研究院與中國國家安全部有聯繫。</summary></entry><entry><title>FirstDate：新加坡用諾貝爾奬演算法，為公務員配對約會對象</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c60e3e4yn858o/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-02T05:53:25Z</updated><published>2026-10-01T04:43:34Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c60e3e4yn858o/trad--090efb241fee.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c60e3e4yn858o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">FirstDate推出之際，這個人口老化的國家正面臨歷來最低的生育率。</summary></entry><entry><title>中國人工智慧工具「教導」研究人員製造生物武器</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c64grn5g7em2o/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-02T05:53:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-30T02:20:26Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c64grn5g7em2o/trad--4c69da1a77f0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c64grn5g7em2o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">有研究機構發現月之暗面的Kimi模型可以繞過開發者的安全限制，提供製造生化武器的資訊。</summary></entry><entry><title>貓眼如何啟發機器人的照相機技術發展</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crz9zd51289jo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-02T05:53:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-30T04:54:09Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crz9zd51289jo/trad--1e0f028ac70a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crz9zd51289jo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">據說曾啟發反光道路標記發明數十年後，貓眼的形狀和「發光」現象如今正被工程師仿效，用於設計高科技相機。</summary></entry><entry><title>美軍撤離伊拉克：駐軍20年留下什麼遺產？接下來會發生什麼？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr5ye133p55qo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-02T05:53:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-30T00:18:50Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr5ye133p55qo/trad--568cd9d10c5c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr5ye133p55qo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國計劃於9月30日前從伊拉克撤出剩餘部隊，結束自2003年美國領導的推翻薩達姆·侯賽因政權的入侵以來在伊拉克的軍事存在。</summary></entry><entry><title>韓國「習近平餐館」遭中國人跨境噴漆襲擊</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq74e2y0x2jno/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-02T05:53:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-30T08:23:06Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq74e2y0x2jno/trad--97826f60efb0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq74e2y0x2jno/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">老闆表示，他選擇這個名字，是因為希望經營「韓國最好的中餐館」。</summary></entry><entry><title>機師刀刺同僚企圖劫機 杜拜往以色列航班乘客化解空難</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck3rerpdp7x9o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-10-02T05:53:25Z</updated><published>2026-10-01T06:20:54Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck3rerpdp7x9o/trad--749b0d4eb1b4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck3rerpdp7x9o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">一架從阿聯酋杜拜飛往以色列的「杜拜航空」（Flydubai）客機上，發生企圖空中劫機事件。其中一名機師刺傷另一名機副機後，機上乘客在機人員協助下闖進駕駛艙並合力制伏施襲者。以色列即將舉行大選，當局尚未透露涉案副機師的施襲動機。</summary></entry><entry><title>中國、台灣民眾如何看「習特會」？專家如何解讀峰會成果？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmq5x6557lqdo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-10-02T05:53:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-25T14:18:56Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmq5x6557lqdo/trad--18f15465e5e4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmq5x6557lqdo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">中國國家主席習近平時隔11年再次訪美進行國是訪問，與美國總統特朗普舉行今年第二次會晤。今次「習特會」有哪些成果？中國及台灣民眾又如何看待？</summary></entry><entry><title>中美AI競賽：世界變得更危險還是更安全？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwx2zmzd63gxo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-10-02T05:53:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-25T08:12:02Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwx2zmzd63gxo/trad--d8f0d79e0ed7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwx2zmzd63gxo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">BBC與嘉賓將共同分析中美兩國在AI技術發展過程中面臨的挑戰、兩國在AI監管與發展等問題上的分歧。</summary></entry><entry><title>習近平訪美晤特朗普：中美競賽誰領先？美國民眾怎麼看</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckddvj0jy3zgo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-10-02T05:53:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-26T02:51:55Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckddvj0jy3zgo/trad--fda815467f9f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckddvj0jy3zgo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">「特習會2.0」即將登場，此時中美競爭白熱化、亦敵亦友，美國民眾認為誰正在領先？BBC中文走訪紐約街頭，聽聽他們最期待兩位元首討論哪些議題？美國大眾眼中的習近平與特朗普又是如何？</summary></entry><entry><title>草原上的數據中心：中國AI雄心背後的算力前線</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crje8gjn3nl5o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-10-02T05:53:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-23T13:24:03Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crje8gjn3nl5o/trad--62ff8006dc2a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crje8gjn3nl5o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">在中國內蒙古遼闊的草原上，數十座數據中心正以驚人速度拔地而起。曾經的農田與草原，正在快速轉變為支撐中國AI雄心的「引擎」，以滿足狂飆的算力需求。</summary></entry><entry><title>特朗普排除美中合作開發人工智能</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm5ye14v6n8xo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-10-02T05:53:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-30T04:39:30Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm5ye14v6n8xo/trad--fb69b70800e6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm5ye14v6n8xo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國總統繼續拒絕為人工智慧設立監管措施的呼籲，認為這將扼殺人工智慧的發展。</summary></entry><entry><title>特朗普習近平峰會：沒有說出口的議題可能更重要</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmzxzl450p2no/trad#3</id><updated>2026-10-02T05:53:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-29T03:48:29Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmzxzl450p2no/trad--249695977d55.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmzxzl450p2no/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">白宮峰會最耐人尋味之處，或許在於中美兩國領導人沒有說哪些事，以及我們至今仍不知道哪些事。</summary></entry><entry><title>為何特朗普在國宴上送習近平一座華麗的白頭海鵰雕像？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3qjkx1wdyyxo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-10-02T05:53:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-25T04:56:06Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3qjkx1wdyyxo/trad--c71e11bddace.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3qjkx1wdyyxo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">從紅杉木長椅到DVD，饋贈禮物一直是外交藝術的重要一環。</summary></entry><entry><title>美中各從「白宮習特會」得到什麼？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq2dwkw2j0r4o/trad#3</id><updated>2026-10-02T05:53:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-25T12:15:11Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq2dwkw2j0r4o/trad--0b8992f22340.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq2dwkw2j0r4o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">外界關注的人工智能、稀土等迫切議題，兩國似乎未有明顯進展。但有學者向BBC中文分析，會談最重要的成就在於展示兩國關係「正面友好的氛圍和形象」。</summary></entry><entry><title>從年輕縣官到國家主席：習近平41年來的訪美影像</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9zrz24j8pdvo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-10-02T05:53:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-22T14:36:55Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9zrz24j8pdvo/trad--63b1eb81b86b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9zrz24j8pdvo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">習近平即將到訪美國會晤特朗普（川普），這將是他歷來第11次以中國官方身份訪美。從31歲縣委書記到中國國家主席，BBC中文透過歷年照片，回顧他的訪美行程如何隨身份和中美關係變化。</summary></entry><entry><title>亦敵亦友：澳洲如何在超級大國競爭中找平衡？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6lyq5d3g9j8o/trad#4</id><updated>2026-10-02T05:53:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-29T05:46:42Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6lyq5d3g9j8o/trad--efcdc20021dc.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6lyq5d3g9j8o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">澳洲越來越擔心中國的軍事實力——但北京也是其最大的貿易夥伴。</summary></entry><entry><title>中國年輕人的「學術偶像」項飆：他讀懂了一代人的焦慮</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crd6888x916go/trad#4</id><updated>2026-10-02T05:53:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-27T01:35:32Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crd6888x916go/trad--fbd128076e6c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crd6888x916go/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">中國的經濟和科技發展迅猛，但也有很多令Z世代擔憂的事情。</summary></entry><entry><title>「雙休購」爆紅與下架：一個網購平台如何撬動勞工權益討論</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr9dw3z7v01yo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-10-02T05:53:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-22T10:03:59Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr9dw3z7v01yo/trad--b8c19d3c8d4b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr9dw3z7v01yo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">提倡雙休的民間自發平台「雙休購」曇花一現後快速被下架，中國打工人開始在社交媒體上要求雙休正當權利。學者指這樣的消費抵制是正向的發展。</summary></entry><entry><title>日本以街道整潔無瑕而聞名，但為什麼公共垃圾桶卻如此難找？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c69v9207z2vwo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-10-02T05:53:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-23T06:50:29Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c69v9207z2vwo/trad--88c7839168c3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c69v9207z2vwo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">如果你花一天時間在東京觀光，可能會發現自己一路拿著空咖啡杯、7-Eleven蛋三明治的包裝紙，以及愈來愈強烈的困惑感。日本以重視整潔聞名，那麼，為什麼卻找不到地方丟垃圾呢？</summary></entry><entry><title>專家評中國修《國防動員法》：吸俄烏教訓實現「平戰快速轉換」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c4gr202jdzpo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-10-02T05:53:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-14T00:19:09Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c4gr202jdzpo/trad--216c74954be4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c4gr202jdzpo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">新法還首次明定，18至60歲男性、18至55歲女性原則上須擔負國防勤務；金融、交通、電信、能源、醫療、糧食等關鍵領域，在動員期間均可採取特別措施。</summary></entry><entry><title>數百艘中國漁船出現在越南外海，北京想要什麼？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck1l6ynmmvlvo/trad#5</id><updated>2026-10-02T05:53:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-25T07:22:44Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck1l6ynmmvlvo/trad--bbc4a6721c27.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck1l6ynmmvlvo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">近年愈來愈多中國漁船在越南外海活動，部分更有執法和政府船隻伴隨。研究人員認為，這不只是捕魚，也涉及北京在南海的主權聲索和地緣政治盤算，而越南漁民的生計和作業空間正受到愈來愈大壓力。</summary></entry><entry><title>「你有五年規劃，我有移民計劃」：香港年輕人為何焦慮？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw804230yrjzo/trad#5</id><updated>2026-10-02T05:53:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-23T18:19:34Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw804230yrjzo/trad--de8c1aec18c6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw804230yrjzo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">9月16日，香港特首李家超發表香港首個五年規劃文件及年度施政報告。但在網絡上，部分年輕人卻開始討論如何離開香港。BBC中文訪問三位香港青年，了解他們的看法。</summary></entry><entry><title>香港提出「人民幣支付政府開支」為何引發「去美元化」憂慮？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c65y501pjww4o/trad#5</id><updated>2026-10-02T05:53:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-23T03:20:25Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c65y501pjww4o/trad--ae05eae289a9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c65y501pjww4o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">有經濟學者對BBC中文指出，港府希望建立「示範作用」，未來甚至「可能連收稅都收人民幣」，增加其他國家在香港使用人民幣買賣黃金、投資股票的信心。</summary></entry><entry><title>中國強勢下，歐洲電池工業謀求「重新充電」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cn8ex870p05o/trad#5</id><updated>2026-10-02T05:53:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-14T00:19:18Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cn8ex870p05o/trad--fa0b5dd070c0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cn8ex870p05o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">歐洲擁有一些前景可期的電池技術，但它能否追回被中國電池巨頭拉開的差距？</summary></entry><entry><title>2026台灣地方選舉：「九合一」為何重要？選舉時程是什麼？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cp931k7xx4do/trad#5</id><updated>2026-10-02T05:53:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-16T04:47:26Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cp931k7xx4do/trad--d50ebbd623d5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cp931k7xx4do/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">台灣的地方選舉又稱「九合一」選舉，每四年一次，多數落在總統任期中段的年底，故被視為總統的「期中考」。</summary></entry><entry><title>感情走下坡還有救嗎？伴侶治療師談修復關係的要素</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqvgy2z0r958o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-10-02T05:53:25Z</updated><published>2026-10-01T02:35:05Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqvgy2z0r958o/trad--118aea5581ec.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqvgy2z0r958o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">批評、輕蔑、防衛、冷處理——這四種行為顯示你的關係可能正走向分手。但感情還是能挽救的，伴侶治療師提出了一些具體建議。</summary></entry><entry><title>人工智能末世論：為什麼有人相信AI是敵基督，誘騙人類崇拜撒旦</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c54g7dr9nlkpo/trad#6</id><updated>2026-10-02T05:53:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-29T00:07:32Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c54g7dr9nlkpo/trad--ffab2177ccfe.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c54g7dr9nlkpo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">許多知名基督徒在 TikTok、播客、出版物等各種平台上開始討論人工智能是否會成為世界毀滅的催化劑。</summary></entry><entry><title>在印尼一座熱帶島嶼上，備受珍視的「永恆積雪」即將永遠消失</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwly54drj5l1o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-10-02T05:53:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-29T00:07:17Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwly54drj5l1o/trad--98f7f9cf887c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwly54drj5l1o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">氣候變化正改變著印尼巴布亞長年被積雪覆蓋的山峰，而這些山峰不但具有科學價值，還有其精神意義。</summary></entry><entry><title>為何成年後才突然過敏？新冠、抗生素甚至蜱蟲都可能是誘因</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck05rqdz4zy3o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-10-02T05:53:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-27T04:39:59Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck05rqdz4zy3o/trad--bb339c428f8a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck05rqdz4zy3o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">我們往往以為，過敏是童年時期，甚至出生前就已埋下的「倒霉伏線」。但其實，「任何人在人生任何階段，都可能突然出現新的過敏」。</summary></entry><entry><title>外星生命會讓我們生病嗎？太空微生物帶來哪些風險</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crq5xp9n7gv2o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-10-02T05:53:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-23T00:29:19Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crq5xp9n7gv2o/trad--9bbfe3670ade.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crq5xp9n7gv2o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">數十年來，我們一直在尋找地球以外的生命。然而，如果我們發現的是微生物，就必須確保它們不會令我們染病。</summary></entry></feed>
